db/add "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068" :answer-field/choices "b6b09ea2-6fd5-5a17-b1ae-a7f21afc0f38"] [:db/add "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068" :answer-field/choices "841d287f-b921-555f-a7bd-2ed68b9194e2"] [:db/add "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068" :answer-field/choices "be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f"] [:db/add "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068" :answer-field/choices "63c42f40-71d8-5fdb-8f32-e1f04145be67"] [:db/add "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068" :answer-field/correct "be8ed56a-77e5-5d2f-86d1-c1ec7630b79f"] [:db/ensure "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf" :question/id #uuid "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf"] [:db/add "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}} 2 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\\\x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}} 2 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{\\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0,\\quad \\sin{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=-1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}=\\left(-1\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n-1.\n$$"] [:db/add "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf" :question/answer-fields "36d03b85-8ee7-53c0-a0fa-a4163b14f068"] [:db/ensure "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "fa64c59d-5f3f-5931-be67-99fe5fe1efaf"] [:db/add "814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626" :answer/id #uuid "814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626"] [:db/add "814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}"] [:db/ensure "814bca97-d46a-53aa-924b-2265e2eb4626" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9" :answer/id #uuid "c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9"] [:db/add "c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}"] [:db/ensure "c986c1f2-1217-5762-9647-2964aa4fc7e9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0" :answer/id #uuid "bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0"] [:db/add "bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "bc3be031-e85f-5d0a-bc61-0582c03dccb0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df" :answer/id #uuid "b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df"] [:db/add "b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}"] [:db/ensure "b6110b66-1020-56ef-85ea-6c010c5983df" :answer/validate] [:db/add "99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5" :answer/id #uuid "99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5"] [:db/add "99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5" :answer/value "0"] [:db/ensure "99d3b62c-9882-56a8-aa19-d3ed83fd9ab5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "37160a5f-0f7a-52e6-a471-2cfc5367c04e" :answer-field/id #uuid "37160a