n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5" :question/answer-fields "9400ddb2-804b-562b-9fe3-e43ad7b5ad37"] [:db/ensure "2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "2ab783b4-dae3-5806-8178-6b89f00052e5"] [:db/add "715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34" :answer/id #uuid "715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34"] [:db/add "715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34" :answer/value "2 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "715b2b16-7d4b-5690-8024-457658cfef34" :answer/validate] [:db/add "229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f" :answer/id #uuid "229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f"] [:db/add "229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f" :answer/value "\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "229f00dc-eebc-5374-a767-58a70b5e6e0f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e" :answer/id #uuid "fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e"] [:db/add "fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e" :answer/value "\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "fff01070-208c-5143-a954-5979fb080d5e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "710505d7-c489-55d0-bf87-c3dd9bd097a3" :answer/id #uuid "