"3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08" :question/answer-fields "dffad44f-3886-5dda-a84e-3bef46f61ecc"] [:db/ensure "3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "3dde2202-3bf2-57e3-9868-9c4b0fc89c08"] [:db/add "aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41" :answer/id #uuid "aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41"] [:db/add "aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}"] [:db/ensure "aee29546-5752-5a1c-a1b5-9c4320867d41" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378" :answer/id #uuid "a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378"] [:db/add "a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{6}"] [:db/ensure "a43c208e-6d08-543c-8f52-6b73d8b5a378" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68" :answer/id #uuid "e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68"] [:db/add "e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}"] [:db/ensure "e889e874-4655-57c6-981b-e4e5a9fb7c68" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d453fb