4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230" :question/answer-fields "1746cf53-43b7-5430-baf2-fd0b240080f9"] [:db/ensure "66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "66ade998-4eef-53a7-accd-bf6073145230"] [:db/add "f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c" :answer/id #uuid "f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c"] [:db/add "f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c" :answer/value "- \\frac{9}{2}"] [:db/ensure "f662d8d3-2f5b-5913-bd49-f9fc6317084c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611" :answer/id #uuid "4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611"] [:db/add "4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611" :answer/value "- \\frac{5}{2}"] [:db/ensure "4d839729-7f15-578f-978e-3a77ba751611