90c4f5630" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92" :question/id #uuid "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92"] [:db/add "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}}^{\\pi} 3 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nChoose the exact value."] [:db/add "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\pi&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}}^{\\pi} 3 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=0,\\quad \\cos{\\left(2 \\pi \\right)}=1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi}=\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92" :question/answer-fields "c453aa4c-7753-59ed-bc06-9be90c4f5630"] [:db/ensure "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "6329419e-ab03-57ca-88f1-9524cf1bfa92"] [:db/add "0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9" :answer/id #uuid "0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9"] [:db/add "0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0dccc8fe-ec04-5c69-a772-13cd9900e1b9" :answer/value "\\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x \\rig